{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock the last remnants of power in a world stripped of magic!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s inside?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Master's Elixir x 20</strong> - Used outside of combat. Increases base experience from battles by three times. Lasts for 60 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791310/extras/_masterElixir690.jpg?t=1751628490\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Licensed Energy Infusion x 20</strong> - Increases current and maximum health in battle by 20% of the base value.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791310/extras/_liscenced690.jpg?t=1751628490\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jinn's lamp x 20</strong> - Summons a real Jinn to aid you in battle, a powerful 14th level warrior of the deserts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791310/extras/_jinn690.jpg?t=1751628490\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to claim?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available at level 3</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automatically sent to in-game mail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Works for any number of characters</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791310?t=1751628490","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3791310?t=1751628490","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3791310/3a4800b31564eb2e7d4ff485687651dfacac393c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751628490","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akam